  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&amp;nbsp;  The project development objective is improved enabling environment for African agricultural programs and policiesat national and regional level. The objective will be achieved by building the SADC-FANR&amp;rsquo;s capacity to provide support for TA, capacity building, analytical work, consultation, and policy dialogue through CAADP-related processes at both national and regional level.</narrative>
  </description>
